<p>It's a no vote for me. Given that this SCP targets family members and not the viewers themselves, why would they ever test it? Even on D-Class, the loss of some random non-D class citizen should be unacceptable for the Foundation. If there was some addendum that testing was done before full knowledge of its effects, that would be fine.</p>
